    'body' => <<<'HTML'
<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>The insurance adjuster is hired and paid by your insurer. A public adjuster is licensed by the Texas Department of Insurance (TDI) and represents only you, the policyholder.</li>
