<li>Hail season in Hidalgo County peaks in April and May, and big events like April 21, 2023 and May 8, 2025 send many claims to carriers at once.</li>
<li>Representation is most useful when the claim is large, disputed, underpaid, or denied. Not every hail claim needs it.</li>
